// Lucide-style icon set (24×24 viewbox, stroke-only). The web loads lucide SVG
// components; Slint cannot render SVG here, so the same shapes are re-expressed
// as Slint Path command strings. Font glyphs were the first attempt and turned
// into tofu (no Windows symbol font resolved for ✥/⌫/▦…), so icons are drawn.
